          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi bikarangwa ahali Ninive; nikyo kitabo ky'ebyo Nahumu owa Elikoshi yabonekeirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninive muntu ayabaire nayenda kushenga Omukama, akategekera kubi abandi, tiyarugire ahali iwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Abaisiraeli Omukama nabagambira ati, “N'orwo baraba bali bangi baina amani, balisilika bahweho. Ndikaba mbahaire ekibonabonyio, tindikibaha rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaasiria ndibamara amani g'okubatwara, nshube inywe mbaguture eminyororo ebakomire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambire ati aha Baasiria, “Timuligira baijukuru ba kwijukirwaho. Omuli rwensinga ya baruhanga banyu ndichwamu ebishushani ebibaijano n'ebiheshano; nshube mbalimire enyanga, kuba nimushusha ebinyamunuge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, entumwa elesirwe aha mabanga neleta amakuru garungi, nabatona emilembe! Inywe bantu ba Yuda mwekomye ebiro bikuru mara muhikye ebiragano byanyu. Omubisha talishuba kutabalira nsi yanyu; asilikire yahweraho kimoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
